WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.043
The fairies were trapped in the drawer.

2
00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:17.335
Sprite pushed on it. "It won't move!"

3
00:00:17.336 --> 00:00:21.485
"I used all my light powder," Hob said.

4
00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:26.814
"We're going to fail the test!" Feather moaned.

5
00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:29.829
Sprite glanced at the Fairy Queen.

6
00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.622
"It's not our fault we're stuck in here!"

7
00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:38.398
Hob, Bumble, and Feather gasped. "Sprite!"

8
00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:42.749
The Queen nodded. "You're right, Sprite.

9
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.910
I hit the clock."

10
00:00:47.911 --> 00:00:50.743
"It's okay," Bumble said.

11
00:00:50.744 --> 00:00:53.852
"I make lots of mistakes."

12
00:00:53.853 --> 00:01:00.687
"But I'm a queen," the Fairy Queen said. "I . . ."

13
00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:04.086
Bumble blinked in surprise.

14
00:01:04.087 --> 00:01:11.869
The Queen was crying!

15
00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:15.558
"Aw, don't feel bad," Feather said.

16
00:01:15.559 --> 00:01:20.406
"Everybody makes mistakes."

17
00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:23.649
"Even me!" Sprite said.

18
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.971
The Queen shook her head.

19
00:01:25.972 --> 00:01:29.887
"I'm not crying about that."

20
00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:32.887
"Then what's wrong?" Bumble asked.

21
00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:42.702
The Queen sobbed. "I don't like small spaces!"

22
00:01:42.703 --> 00:01:45.561
Hob patted her arm.

23
00:01:45.562 --> 00:01:48.724
"Nick will probably come back soon."

24
00:01:48.725 --> 00:01:54.427
The Queen sobbed harder.

25
00:01:54.428 --> 00:02:01.434
"We could be trapped in here forever!"

26
00:02:01.435 --> 00:02:05.574
"Let's try to open the drawer," Bumble said.

27
00:02:05.575 --> 00:02:08.495
"Huh?" Sprite said.

28
00:02:08.496 --> 00:02:12.738
"Let's fly at it all at once," Bumble said.

29
00:02:12.739 --> 00:02:24.121
The Queen blew her nose. "It might work."

30
00:02:24.122 --> 00:02:27.354
Together the fairies slammed into the drawer.

31
00:02:27.355 --> 00:02:31.602
Creak! The drawer opened a little.

32
00:02:31.603 --> 00:02:35.909
They flew again . . . it moved some more.

33
00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:41.027
"Again!" Bumble cried.

34
00:02:41.028 --> 00:02:44.774
It opened wide, and they flew out.

35
00:02:44.775 --> 00:02:48.044
Bumble put the wishbit back.

36
00:02:48.045 --> 00:02:51.556
A fancy watch appeared.

37
00:02:51.557 --> 00:02:57.799
Sprite grinned. "Wish granted!"

38
00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:01.529
"You passed," the Queen said.

39
00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:07.290
"Were we fast enough for the reward?" Feather asked.

40
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:17.616
The Queen glanced at a clock. "We'll see."

41
00:03:17.617 --> 00:03:21.366
Later the Queen spoke to the fairies.

42
00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:25.142
"You were too slow to get the reward."

43
00:03:25.143 --> 00:03:33.493
"Ugh!" Sprite groaned, and Feather sighed.

44
00:03:33.494 --> 00:03:38.854
"But Bumble thought fast, so he gets a gift."

45
00:03:38.855 --> 00:03:42.629
The Queen snapped her fingers. Poof!

46
00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:52.847
A book appeared near Bumble.

47
00:03:52.848 --> 00:04:04.517
"The new Super Fairy book!" he cried.

48
00:04:04.518 --> 00:04:13.540
"What a great birthday!"

